IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOOP.
*> Torture test: infinite PERFORM loop (killed by timeout 10)
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I PIC 9(3) VALUE 1.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-I > 1000000
        DISPLAY "Loop iteration: " WS-I
        ADD 1 TO WS-I
    END-PERFORM.
    STOP RUN.